  "content": "<h1>感謝下載量突破10萬！！</h1>\n<h2>Mod將會被重新制作/改寫</h2>\n<p>MINECRAFT裡的變色龍是什麼？沒聽錯，你可以在這裡發現變色龍、爬行動物、蜥蜴、喙頭鱉以及兩棲動物。你可以讓Minecraft動物更加豐富，享受尋找它們並轉化成寵物的樂趣 =3。<br>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/777/529/310/172/sprite-0001_scaled_32x_pngcrushed.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/776/395/310/172/sem-titulo-1-_scaled_3x_pngcrushed.png\"><br>&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;</p>\n<p>==擁有可愛的、稀有的及其他!==<br>🦖🐢🐍🦎🐸🐊🐲🐉</p>\n<p>爬行動物:<br>-喙頭鱉<br>-鬃獅蜥<br>-泰圭蜥<br>-吉拉毒蜥<br>-海洋 iguana</p>\n<p>&nbsp;==還有更多==</p>\n<p>兩棲動物:<br>-蠑螈<br>-歐氏鰹鮫<br>-中國大鯢</p>\n<p>==還有更多==</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/813/597/sem-tatulo-5-min.png\" alt=\"屏幕截图缩略图\" width=\"415\" height=\"415\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;==加入我們的Discord伺服器以獲得更多更新==</p>\n<p>任何錯誤都可以在那裡和&nbsp;評論中報告</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/yAdCkxqbav\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/yAdCkxqbav</a></p>",
